  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7487103030681665538",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/supplychainaipro_the-ai-tools-arent-your-competitive-advantage-activity-7487052739462590465-KGTz",
    "content": "The AI tools aren't your competitive advantage anymore.\n\n𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗳𝗿𝗮𝗺𝗲𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸𝘀 𝗮𝗿𝗲.\n\nEveryone has access to Claude.\nEveryone has access to ChatGPT.\n\nThe real advantage comes from 𝗵𝗼𝘄 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝘀𝘁𝗿𝘂𝗰𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝗻𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴.\n\nThat's exactly why these 𝟴 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗔𝗜 𝗙𝗿𝗮𝗺𝗲𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸𝘀 exist.\n\nThey're designed to help you move from:\n\n❌ Asking better questions\n\n➡️\n\n✅ 𝗕𝘂𝗶𝗹𝗱𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗯𝗲𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗱𝗲𝗰𝗶𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀.\n\nBecause 𝗔𝗜 𝗯𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲𝘀 𝗽𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿𝗳𝘂𝗹 only when 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗶𝘀.\n\nWhich framework would you add to this list?\n👇 Share your thoughts.\n\n🔔 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 Asmaa Gad & Supply Chain AI Pro for more AI insights!",
