  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7486310455578230785",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/supplychainaipro_everyone-is-talking-about-ai-very-few-are-activity-7486310455578230785-TryH",
    "content": "Everyone is talking about AI.\n\nVery few are talking about 𝗵𝗼𝘄 𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗰𝘁𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗹𝘆 𝗺𝗮𝗸𝗲 𝗶𝘁 𝗽𝗮𝗿𝘁 𝗼𝗳 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁.\n\nA while ago, I was using Claude like most people…\n\nOne prompt.\nOne answer.\nRepeat.\n\nThen I changed one thing.\n\nI stopped asking:\n\"Can Claude help me with this task?\"\n\nAnd started asking:\n\"𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝗰𝗮𝗻 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘂𝗱𝗲 𝗯𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲 𝗽𝗮𝗿𝘁 𝗼𝗳 𝗺𝘆 𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸𝗳𝗹𝗼𝘄?\"\n\nThat simple mindset shift changed everything.\n\nInstead of using Claude as just another chatbot, I built a 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗔𝗜 𝗦𝘁𝗮𝗰𝗸 that supports every stage of the procurement lifecycle.\n\n📂 Give Claude the 𝗿𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗲𝘅𝘁.\n🔗 Connect it to the 𝘁𝗼𝗼𝗹𝘀 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝗮𝗹𝗿𝗲𝗮𝗱𝘆 𝘂𝘀𝗲.\n🧠 Analyze data and uncover 𝗶𝗻𝘀𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀.\n✍️ Draft documents 𝗳𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿.\n✅ Review and improve with 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗳𝗶𝗱𝗲𝗻𝗰𝗲.\n📊 Track 𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗺𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲.\n📈 Capture lessons learned and 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗻𝘂𝗼𝘂𝘀𝗹𝘆 𝗶𝗺𝗽𝗿𝗼𝘃𝗲.\n\nThe biggest productivity boost doesn't come from better prompts.\n\nIt comes from building a 𝗿𝗲𝗽𝗲𝗮𝘁𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗔𝗜 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸𝗳𝗹𝗼𝘄 that delivers consistent results not just good answers.\n\nBecause at the end of the day…\n\n𝗔𝗜 𝗶𝘀𝗻'𝘁 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗮𝗱𝘃𝗮𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗴𝗲.\n𝗔 𝘄𝗲𝗹𝗹 𝗱𝗲𝘀𝗶𝗴𝗻𝗲𝗱 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸𝗳𝗹𝗼𝘄 𝗶𝘀.\n\n🔔 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 Asmaa Gad & Supply Chain AI Pro for more AI insights!",
