  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7487462980238942208",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/supplychainaipro_%F0%9D%97%AA%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%98%82%F0%9D%97%B9%F0%9D%97%B1-%F0%9D%98%86%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%98%82-%F0%9D%97%B8%F0%9D%97%BB%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%98%84-%F0%9D%97%B6%F0%9D%97%B3-%F0%9D%98%86%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%98%82%F0%9D%97%BF-activity-7487462980238942208-Vizb",
    "content": "𝗪𝗼𝘂𝗹𝗱 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝗸𝗻𝗼𝘄 𝗶𝗳 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗯𝗲𝘀𝘁 𝘀𝘂𝗽𝗽𝗹𝗶𝗲𝗿 𝗯𝗲𝗰𝗮𝗺𝗲 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗯𝗶𝗴𝗴𝗲𝘀𝘁 𝗿𝗶𝘀𝗸 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀 𝘄𝗲𝗲𝗸?\n\nMost procurement teams track suppliers.\n𝗩𝗲𝗿𝘆 𝗳𝗲𝘄 𝗮𝗰𝘁𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗹𝘆 𝘀𝗰𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗲𝗺.\n\nA supplier can still deliver on time…\n\n✔️ But their 𝗳𝗶𝗻𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗶𝗮𝗹 𝗵𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵 is declining.\n✔️ 𝗘𝗦𝗚 𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗺𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 is deteriorating.\n✔️ 𝗢𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝗮𝗹 𝗿𝗶𝘀𝗸𝘀 are increasing.\n✔️ 𝗦𝘁𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗴𝗶𝗰 𝗶𝗺𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 is changing.\n\nBy the time these issues appear in a quarterly review… 𝗜𝘁'𝘀 𝗮𝗹𝗿𝗲𝗮𝗱𝘆 𝘁𝗼𝗼 𝗹𝗮𝘁𝗲.\n\nThat's why we built the 𝗔𝗜 𝗦𝘂𝗽𝗽𝗹𝗶𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝗰𝗼𝗿𝗲𝗰𝗮𝗿𝗱 𝗦𝘆𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗺.\n\nInstead of relying on spreadsheets and manual reviews, it helps procurement teams evaluate suppliers using an 𝟴 𝗱𝗶𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻𝗮𝗹 𝘄𝗲𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗳𝗿𝗮𝗺𝗲𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸, powered by AI.\n\n💎 Inside the toolkit you'll find:\n\n• AI ready Excel scorecards\n• 150 procurement prompts\n• GPT, Claude & Gemini workflows\n• Power BI dashboard templates\n• QBR templates\n• Industry specific weighting profiles\n\nBecause supplier performance isn't just about OTIF anymore. It's about 𝗶𝗱𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗳𝘆𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗿𝗶𝘀𝗸𝘀 𝗯𝗲𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗲𝘆 𝗶𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗰𝘁 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗯𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗻𝗲𝘀𝘀.\n\nExplore the complete Procurement Dashboards Toolkit here:\n🔗 https://lnkd.in/eD6c2Q_x\n\n💬 What's the #1 KPI you look at when evaluating suppliers? 👇\n\n🔔 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 Asmaa Gad & Supply Chain AI Pro for more Procurement AI insights!",
