  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7486672841543925760",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/supplychainaipro_%F0%9D%97%A3%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%97%B0%F0%9D%98%82%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%97%B2%F0%9D%97%BA%F0%9D%97%B2%F0%9D%97%BB%F0%9D%98%81-%F0%9D%97%AF%F0%9D%97%B2%F0%9D%97%B3%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%97%B2-%F0%9D%97%96%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%97%BB%F0%9D%97%BB%F0%9D%97%B2%F0%9D%97%B0%F0%9D%98%81%F0%9D%97%BC%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%98%80-activity-7486672841543925760-Fk9F",
    "content": "𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗯𝗲𝗳𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘀:\n\n👨‍💼\n\"Open Excel.\"\n\"Now check SAP.\"\n\"Search SharePoint.\"\n\"Read Outlook.\"\n\"Open Teams.\"\n\"Find the contract.\"\n\"Compare supplier data.\"\n\n😵‍💫\n\n──────────────────\n\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘂𝗱𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘀:\n\n🤖\n\"𝗗𝗼𝗻𝗲.\"\n\n──────────────────\n\nThat's the difference between 𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗜…\nand 𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗔𝗜.\n\nThese 𝟮𝟬 𝗖𝗹𝗮𝘂𝗱𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘀 can turn Claude into a true procurement assistant by linking it with your everyday tools.\n\nBecause 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝘀𝗺𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗲𝘀𝘁 𝗔𝗜 𝗶𝘀 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗮𝗹𝗿𝗲𝗮𝗱𝘆 𝗸𝗻𝗼𝘄𝘀 𝘄𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗱𝗮𝘁𝗮 𝗹𝗶𝘃𝗲𝘀.\n\nWhich integration would make your work easier?👇 Drop it in the comments.\n\n──────────────────\n\n🔔 𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 Asmaa Gad & Supply Chain AI Pro for more AI insights!",
